---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
const credentials=[
 {title:'Google Data Analytics',issuer:'Google · Coursera',date:'August 2022',url:'https://www.credly.com/badges/6b1e0514-119d-40bb-9cba-1c76e12a9f17/public_url'},
 {title:'Advanced Data Analysis Nanodegree',issuer:'Egypt FWD · Udacity',date:'October 2022',url:'https://www.udacity.com/certificate/e/73c44122-2a41-11ed-a5cd-c77bfc64b77e'},
 {title:'Data Analysis Challenger',issuer:'Egypt FWD · Udacity',date:'April 2022',url:'https://www.udacity.com/certificate/e/f7342794-c0eb-11ec-962d-83088c833500'},
];
---
<Base title="About" description="Meet Moaaz Magdy: a business analyst in Cairo working with operational data, reporting, dashboards, and practical tools." hideFooter>
 <div class="about-page">
  <header class="about-opening">
   <div><h1>Business questions.<br />A practical way forward.</h1><p class="introduction">I’m Moaaz, a business analyst based in Cairo. I work with operational data, build reports and dashboards, and explore tools that make analysis easier to repeat and check.</p></div>
   <aside class="personal-note"><svg viewBox="0 0 160 90" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m10 74 40-61 35 61Z m40-61v61 M63 74 30-44 27 44 M105 74l19-29 21 29 M5 79q70-7 149 0"/><path d="m102 20 5-7 m18 8 8-3 m-7 19 9 3"/></g></svg><p>Based in Cairo.<br />Curious about what comes next.</p><a href={SITE.links.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Find me on LinkedIn ↗</a></aside>
  </header>
  <section class="about-section" aria-labelledby="background-title">
   <h2 id="background-title">Business came first.</h2>
   <div class="section-copy"><p>I studied International Business Management at Sadat Academy for Management Sciences. Before working in analysis, customer service internships at QNB and Banque Misr gave me a closer look at everyday banking operations.</p><p>That background shapes the questions I ask: how does the process work, where does information get lost, and what would help someone make a better decision?</p><p>Data analysis became a way to investigate those questions—and building tools became a way to make the work repeatable.</p></div>
  </section>
  <section class="about-section" aria-labelledby="work-title">
   <h2 id="work-title">Where I put that into practice.</h2>
   <div class="work-notes">
    <article><h3>Operational analysis</h3><p class="context">Al-Amal Trade &amp; Distribution · December 2024–present</p><p>I reconcile more than 1,000 financial, inventory, and logistics records each month. I’ve also built and automated more than 10 recurring reports to help teams follow performance and investigate discrepancies.</p></article>
    <article><h3>Dashboards &amp; reporting</h3><p class="context">Freelance work · December 2024–present</p><p>I build sales and HR dashboards and automate recurring reporting, making information easier to explore and reducing the steps involved in preparing it.</p></article>
    <article><h3>Career readiness</h3><p class="context">Mattlob collaboration · September 2026–present</p><p>A current collaboration involving practical career-readiness activities, including role matching, CV review, and workplace skills.</p></article>
   </div>
  </section>
  <section class="about-section" aria-labelledby="build-title">
   <h2 id="build-title">And beyond the day-to-day.</h2>
   <div class="section-copy"><p>I also build projects to explore an idea in more depth. That includes an analytics assistant that validates its reports, a desktop tool for examining document authorship signals, and a customer analytics case study informed by helping a friend with an ecommerce business.</p><p>These projects give me room to try different approaches, inspect the results, and be clear about what a tool can—and cannot—tell us.</p><a class="text-link" href="/projects/">Explore the projects →</a></div>
  </section>
  <section class="about-section" aria-labelledby="tool-title">
   <h2 id="tool-title">The tools follow the question.</h2>
   <dl class="tool-list"><div><dt>Explore &amp; prepare</dt><dd>Excel, SQL, Python, pandas</dd></div><div><dt>Explain &amp; share</dt><dd>Power BI, Tableau, matplotlib</dd></div><div><dt>Build &amp; automate</dt><dd>Python, React, TypeScript, FastAPI, Electron</dd></div></dl>
  </section>
  <section class="about-section" aria-labelledby="learning-title">
   <h2 id="learning-title">Still learning.<br />Always applying.</h2>
   <div class="learning-notes"><p>Alongside my degree, I’ve continued developing my analytical skills through structured training and hands-on work.</p><ul class="training-list"><li><strong>Business Analytics Program</strong><span>Digital Egypt Builders Initiative · November 2025–August 2026</span></li><li><strong>Data Analytics and Visualization Bootcamp</strong><span>Sprints · Completed 18 March 2025</span></li></ul><div class="credential-list">{credentials.map(c=><a href={c.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span><strong>{c.title}</strong><small>{c.issuer} · {c.date}</small></span><span class="credential-action">View credential ↗</span></a>)}</div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="about-section" aria-labelledby="outside-title"><h2 id="outside-title">A little beyond the work.</h2><div class="section-copy"><p>Around 2018, I volunteered at my former high school to raise awareness of the health risks of smoking. I also completed military service between 2023 and 2024.</p><a class="text-link" href="/#about">Follow the full timeline →</a></div></section>
  <div class="about-close"><h2>Have something in mind?</h2><p>A role, a business question, or an interesting idea to build—I’d like to hear about it.</p><a href="/#connect">Get in touch →</a></div>
 </div>
</Base>
<style>
 .about-page{max-width:1120px;margin:auto;padding:28px 40px 20px;color:#302d28}
 h1,h2,h3{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-weight:500;text-wrap:balance;letter-spacing:-.025em}
 .about-opening{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 220px;gap:50px;align-items:center;padding:12px 0 65px}
 h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,5.5vw,5rem);line-height:1.04;margin:0 0 28px}
 .introduction{font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.85;color:#685e50;max-width:620px;margin:0}
 .personal-note{background:#fffaf0;padding:26px 22px;transform:rotate(3deg);box-shadow:0 10px 25px #44331b12}
 .personal-note svg{width:135px;height:80px;color:#79613e}
 .personal-note p{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-size:1.5rem;line-height:1.2;margin:12px 0 20px}
 .personal-note a{font-size:.73rem}
 a{color:#705832;text-underline-offset:5px}a:hover{color:#342b20}a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #79613e;outline-offset:5px}
 .about-section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:250px minmax(0,1fr);gap:45px;border-top:1px solid #d5c9b4;padding:40px 0 46px}
 h2{font-size:2.3rem;line-height:1.1;margin:0}
 .section-copy p,.work-notes article>p:not(.context),.learning-notes>p{font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.9;color:#685e50;margin:0 0 20px}
 .text-link{display:inline-block;font-size:.85rem;margin-top:8px}
 .work-notes article+article{margin-top:30px}
 h3{font-size:1.85rem;margin:0 0 8px}
 .context{font-size:.72rem;color:#75634a;margin:0 0 12px}
 .work-notes article>p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
 .tool-list{margin:0}.tool-list div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:155px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e3dacb}.tool-list div:first-child{padding-top:0}
 dt{font-size:.82rem;font-weight:650}dd{font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.75;color:#685e50;margin:0}
 .training-list{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:28px 0}.training-list li{margin-bottom:20px}.training-list strong{display:block;font-size:.88rem;font-weight:550}.training-list span{display:block;font-size:.75rem;color:#685e50;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.6}
 .credential-list a{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;text-decoration:none;padding:17px 0;border-top:1px solid #e3dacb;align-items:center}.credential-list strong{font-size:.84rem;font-weight:550}.credential-list small{display:block;color:#685e50;font-size:.72rem;margin-top:6px}.credential-action{font-size:.7rem;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:underline}
 .about-close{padding:45px 0 10px;border-top:1px solid #d5c9b4}.about-close h2{font-size:3rem}.about-close p{color:#685e50;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.8;margin:18px 0 24px}.about-close a{font-size:.9rem}
 @media(max-width:1000px){.about-opening{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 180px;gap:30px}.personal-note{padding:20px 16px}.about-section{grid-template-columns:200px minmax(0,1fr);gap:30px}}
 @media(max-width:800px){.about-opening{grid-template-columns:1fr}.personal-note{max-width:250px;justify-self:end}.about-section{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}}
 @media(max-width:600px){.about-page{padding:12px 24px}.about-opening{padding-bottom:40px}.introduction{font-size:1rem}.personal-note{max-width:220px;margin:8px 5px 0}.about-section{padding:30px 0 34px}h2{font-size:2rem}.tool-list div{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:7px}.credential-list a{align-items:start;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}.about-close h2{font-size:2.5rem}}
</style>
